  "content": "\n\n<p>乘船運送動物與村民再也不會是件苦差事了。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>安裝此模組後，你可以在划船時進行小幅跳躍，讓你能夠從水面直接登上陸地，甚至攀爬小斜坡。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>立即加入「跳跳船」俱樂部 <strong>今天！</strong>，享受免費的濺水樂趣！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>在此觀看實機演示&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fA4EAEFg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://imgur.com/a/A4EAEFg</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>或在此處</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ISqDfYnSpv4?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>需要協助？&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/k3XJkb2puw\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/k3XJkb2puw</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>對應的 Fabric 版本請見此處：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jumpy-boats-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jumpy-boats-fabric</a></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/a/A4EAEFg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252flobstermods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://jonn.dk/akliz_banner_productivebees.png\" alt=\"贊助時間\"></a></p>",
